                <pb facs="0820" n="726" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg726"/>

                <head>No. 469.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manning to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 16, 1886</date>.
                        (Received May 16.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your request for remission of death penalty to Nogales offenders has been
                    presented to Mexican Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manning.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
